flowchart TD
    Start([Mulai: Akses Portal THC]) --> Login[Login via Email + Password / Demo Switcher]
    Login --> CekAuth{Kredensial Valid?}
    CekAuth -- Tidak --> Login
    CekAuth -- Ya --> Dashboard[Dashboard Pengguna]
    
    Dashboard --> PilihAksi{Pilih Aksi}
    PilihAksi -- Buat Kunjungan Baru --> FormRequest[Buka Form Request Site Visit]
    PilihAksi -- Pantau Kunjungan --> DetailVisit[Lihat Detail & QR Kunjungan]
    
    FormRequest --> IsiData[Isi Lokasi, Tujuan, Jadwal & Rombongan Tamu]
    IsiData --> CentangNDA[Centang Persetujuan NDA & Safety Rules]
    CentangNDA --> Validasi{Validasi Input Form}
    Validasi -- Gagal (Data Kurang) --> FormRequest
    Validasi -- Sukses --> Submit[Kirim Permohonan Kunjungan]
    
    Submit --> StatusRequested[Status: requested & Generate Visit ID]
    StatusRequested --> NotifAdmin[Masuk ke Antrean Approval THC Admin]
    NotifAdmin --> TungguApproval[Menunggu Keputusan Approval]
    
    TungguApproval --> HasilApproval{Keputusan Admin}
    HasilApproval -- Approved --> StatusApproved[Status: approved]
    HasilApproval -- Rejected --> StatusRejected[Status: rejected dengan Alasan]
    HasilApproval -- Timeout 7 Hari --> AutoCancel[Status: cancelled]
    
    StatusApproved --> TampilQR[Tampilkan QR Code di Detail Kunjungan]
    TampilQR --> HariH[Hari-H: Datang ke Fasilitas THC]
    HariH --> CheckInGate[Security Check-in di Gerbang]
    CheckInGate --> StatusVisiting[Status: visiting]
    
    StatusVisiting --> SelesaiKunjungan[Kegiatan Selesai]
    SelesaiKunjungan --> CheckOutGate[Security Check-out di Gerbang]
    CheckOutGate --> StatusCompleted[Status: completed]
    
    StatusCompleted --> Selesai([Selesai])
    StatusRejected --> Selesai
    AutoCancel --> Selesai
    DetailVisit --> Selesai